      "text": "游泳",
      "note": "yóuyǒng — to swim"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/kan_shu",
      "text": "看书",
      "note": "kàn shū — to read (a book)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/paizhao",
      "text": "拍照",
      "note": "pāizhào — to take photos"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_xihuan_ti_zuqiu",
      "text": "我喜欢踢足球。",
      "note": "Wǒ xǐhuan tī zúqiú. — I like playing football. (spoken: wó xǐhuan)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/chang_ge",
      "text": "唱歌",
      "note": "chàng gē — to sing"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/xihuan",
      "text": "喜欢",
      "note": "xǐhuan — to like (huan light)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ni_xihuan_zuo_shenme",
      "text": "你喜欢做什么？",
      "note": "Nǐ xǐhuan zuò shénme? — what do you like doing? (spoken: ní xǐhuan)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_xihuan_hua_hua",
      "text": "我喜欢画画。",
      "note": "Wǒ xǐhuan huà huà. — I like drawing. (spoken: wó xǐhuan)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ye",
      "text": "也",
      "note": "yě — also, too"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_ye_xihuan",
      "text": "我也喜欢！",
      "note": "Wǒ yě xǐhuan! — I like it too! (spoken: wó yé xǐhuan)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_xihuan_da_yumaoqiu_ni_ne",
      "text": "我喜欢打羽毛球。你呢？",
      "note": "Wǒ xǐhuan dǎ yǔmáoqiú. Nǐ ne? — I like badminton. And you?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_bu_xihuan_tiaowu",
      "text": "我不喜欢跳舞。",
      "note": "Wǒ bù xǐhuan tiàowǔ. — I don't like dancing."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/lei",
      "text": "累",
      "note": "lèi — tired"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/gaoxing",
      "text": "高兴",
      "note": "gāoxìng — happy"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/e",
      "text": "饿",
      "note": "è — hungry"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/nanguo",
      "text": "难过",
      "note": "nánguò — sad"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_hen_lei",
      "text": "我很累。",
      "note": "Wǒ hěn lèi. — I'm tired. (spoken: wó hěn lèi)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/shengqi",
      "text": "生气",
      "note": "shēngqì — angry"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_hen_nanguo",
      "text": "我很难过。",
      "note": "Wǒ hěn nánguò. — I'm sad. (spoken: wó hěn)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ni_zenme_le",
      "text": "你怎么了？",
      "note": "Nǐ zěnme le? — what's wrong? (caring tone; spoken: ní zěnme le)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_hen_e",
      "text": "我很饿。",
      "note": "Wǒ hěn è. — I'm hungry. (spoken: wó hěn è)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_hen_gaoxing_yinwei_jintian_shi_wo_de_shengri",
      "text": "我很高兴，因为今天是我的生日。",
      "note": "Wǒ hěn gāoxìng, yīnwèi jīntiān shì wǒ de shēngrì. — I'm happy because it's my birthday today."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/yinwei",
      "text": "因为",
      "note": "yīnwèi — because"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/suoyi",
      "text": "所以",
      "note": "suǒyǐ — so, therefore"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/yinwei_wo_hen_e_suoyi_wo_chi_miantiao",
      "text": "因为我很饿，所以我吃面条。",
      "note": "Yīnwèi wǒ hěn è, suǒyǐ wǒ chī miàntiáo. — I'm hungry, so I'm eating noodles."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_zai_jia",
      "text": "我在家",
      "note": "wǒ zài jiā — I stay at home"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ni_weishenme_bu_qu_gongyuan",
      "text": "你为什么不去公园？",
      "note": "Nǐ wèishénme bù qù gōngyuán? — why aren't you going to the park? (bú qù)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/yinwei_xia_yu_le",
      "text": "因为下雨了。",
      "note": "Yīnwèi xià yǔ le. — Because it's raining."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/jita",
      "text": "吉他",
      "note": "jítā — guitar"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/zuqiu",
      "text": "足球",
      "note": "zúqiú — football"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/yumaoqiu",
      "text": "羽毛球",
      "note": "yǔmáoqiú — badminton"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/qing_he_cha",
      "text": "请喝茶。",
      "note": "Qǐng hē chá. — Please have some tea."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/nin_hao",
      "text": "您好！",
      "note": "Nín hǎo! — polite hello (spoken: nín hǎo, no sandhi)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/qing_jin",
      "text": "请进。",
      "note": "Qǐng jìn. — Please come in."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/qing_zuo",
      "text": "请坐。",
      "note": "Qǐng zuò. — Please sit down."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/nin",
      "text": "您",
      "note": "nín — you (polite)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/xiexie_nin",
      "text": "谢谢您！",
      "note": "Xièxie nín! — Thank you (polite)!"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/qing_deng_yixia",
      "text": "请等一下。",
      "note": "Qǐng děng yīxià. — please wait a moment (spoken: qíng děng yíxià)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/guixing",
      "text": "贵姓",
      "note": "guìxìng — surname (polite)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/keyi_yong_yixia_diannao_ma",
      "text": "可以用一下电脑吗？",
      "note": "Kěyǐ yòng yīxià diànnǎo ma? — may I use the computer a moment? (spoken: yòng yíxià)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/zher",
      "text": "这儿",
      "note": "zhèr — here (erhua; Beijing form of 这里)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/keyi",
      "text": "可以",
      "note": "kěyǐ — may, can (spoken: kéyǐ)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/keyi_paizhao_ma",
      "text": "可以拍照吗？",
      "note": "Kěyǐ pāizhào ma? — May I take photos?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/dangran_keyi",
      "text": "当然可以。",
      "note": "Dāngrán kěyǐ. — Of course."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/bu_haoyisi_zher_bu_neng_paizhao",
      "text": "不好意思，这儿不能拍照。",
      "note": "Bù hǎoyìsi, zhèr bù néng pāizhào. — sorry, you can't take photos here (polite but firm; si light)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/bu_haoyisi_ta_zai_kaihui_qing_deng_yixia",
      "text": "不好意思，他在开会。请等一下。",
      "note": "Bù hǎoyìsi, tā zài kāihuì. Qǐng děng yīxià. — Sorry, he's in a meeting. Please wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/dangran_keyi_qing_zuo",
      "text": "当然可以，请坐。",
      "note": "Dāngrán kěyǐ, qǐng zuò. — Of course, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/nin_hao_qingwen_wang_jingli_zai_ma",
      "text": "您好！请问，王经理在吗？",
      "note": "Nín hǎo! Qǐngwèn, Wáng jīnglǐ zài ma? — Hello! Excuse me, is Manager Wang in?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/hao_de_wo_keyi_zuo_zher_ma",
      "text": "好的。我可以坐这儿吗？",
      "note": "Hǎo de. Wǒ kěyǐ zuò zhèr ma? — OK. May I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/bu_haoyisi_bu_xing",
      "text": "不好意思，不行。",
      "note": "Bù hǎoyìsi, bù xíng. — Sorry, I'm afraid not."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/mei_wenti",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "note": "Méi wèntí. — No problem."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_keyi_zuo_zher_ma",
      "text": "我可以坐这儿吗？",
      "note": "Wǒ kěyǐ zuò zhèr ma? — May I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/haokan",
      "text": "好看",
      "note": "hǎokàn — good-looking"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/haochi",
      "text": "好吃",
      "note": "hǎochī — tasty, delicious"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/fangbian",
      "text": "方便",
      "note": "fāngbiàn — convenient"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/you_yisi",
      "text": "有意思",
      "note": "yǒu yìsi — interesting (si light)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_juede_zhege_cai_hen_haochi",
      "text": "我觉得这个菜很好吃。",
      "note": "Wǒ juéde zhège cài hěn hǎochī. — I think this dish is delicious."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/zhe_jian_waitao_zenmeyang",
      "text": "这件外套怎么样？",
      "note": "Zhè jiàn wàitào zěnmeyàng? — What do you think of this jacket?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_juede_hen_haokan",
      "text": "我觉得很好看。",
      "note": "Wǒ juéde hěn hǎokàn. — I think it looks good."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/buguo",
      "text": "不过",
      "note": "bùguò — however (spoken: búguò)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/gui",
      "text": "贵",
      "note": "guì — expensive"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/youdianr",
      "text": "有点儿",
      "note": "yǒudiǎnr — a bit (erhua: yǒudiǎnr)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_ye_zheme_juede",
      "text": "我也这么觉得。",
      "note": "Wǒ yě zhème juéde. — I think so too."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_bu_zheme_juede",
      "text": "我不这么觉得。",
      "note": "Wǒ bù zhème juéde. — I don't think so (spoken: bú zhème)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_tongyi",
      "text": "我同意。",
      "note": "Wǒ tóngyì. — I agree."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_bu_tai_tongyi",
      "text": "我不太同意。",
      "note": "Wǒ bù tài tóngyì. — I don't quite agree (spoken: bú tài)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/huoche_xiawu_san_dian_ban_kai",
      "text": "火车下午三点半开。",
      "note": "Huǒchē xiàwǔ sān diǎn bàn kāi. — The train leaves at 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ji_dian_de",
      "text": "几点的？",
      "note": "Jǐ diǎn de? — for what time? (ticket clerk)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/hao_de_wushiwu_kuai",
      "text": "好的，五十五块。",
      "note": "Hǎo de, wǔshíwǔ kuài. — OK, fifty-five yuan."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/nin_hao_wo_yao_yi_zhang_qu_shanghai_de_piao",
      "text": "您好，我要一张去上海的票。",
      "note": "Nín hǎo, wǒ yào yī zhāng qù Shànghǎi de piào. — one ticket to Shanghai, please (spoken: yì zhāng)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/xiawu_san_dian_ban_de",
      "text": "下午三点半的。",
      "note": "Xiàwǔ sān diǎn bàn de. — The 3:30 pm one."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ni_juede_zenmeyang",
      "text": "你觉得怎么样？",
      "note": "Nǐ juéde zěnmeyàng? — What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_juede_hen_haochi",
      "text": "我觉得很好吃。",
      "note": "Wǒ juéde hěn hǎochī. — I think it's delicious."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/kai",
      "text": "开",
      "note": "kāi — to depart (of a vehicle)"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/ji_dian",
      "text": "几点",
      "note": "jǐ diǎn — what time"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wo_juede_youdianr_gui",
      "text": "我觉得有点儿贵。",
      "note": "Wǒ juéde yǒudiǎnr guì. — I think it's a bit expensive."
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/qu_shanghai_de_piao_duoshao_qian",
      "text": "去上海的票多少钱？",
      "note": "Qù Shànghǎi de piào duōshao qián? — How much is a ticket to Shanghai?"
    },
    {
      "key": "zh/wushiwu_kuai",
      "text": "五十五块。",
      "note": "Wǔshíwǔ kuài. — Fifty-five yuan."
    }
  ]
}
